DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hi
 meji%20Castle%2C%2068%20Honmachi%2C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo%20670-0012\nEntry 
 2\,500 yen for visitors since March 2026. Open 09:00\, last entry 16:00. S
 hoes off inside the keep.\nWalk up Otemae Street from the station\, about 
 15 min\, with the keep straight ahead.\nOne guide reports scaffolding on t
 he keep from July 2026. Look before you pay: if the keep is wrapped\, shoo
 t the grounds and skip the ticket.
