DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261125T124500
SUMMARY:Shinkansen photos at Himeji Station
LOCATION:JR Himeji Station\, Himeji\, Hyogo
DESCRIPTION:Google Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JR
 %20Himeji%20Station%2C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo\nBuy an unreserved Shinkansen t
 icket to Shin-Osaka (about 3\,520 yen). It gets you onto the Shinkansen pl
 atforms.\nNozomi trains run through the middle tracks without stopping\, b
 etween platforms 11 and 12. Stopping trains pull in on either side.\nStay 
 behind the yellow line\, no flash\, and keep the bag out of the walkway. G
 rab an ekiben for the ride.
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JR%20Himeji%20Station%2
 C%20Himeji%2C%20Hyogo
TRANSP:OPAQUE
